      "turnover": 0.1295,
      "max_abs_library_correlation": null,
      "horizon_days": 10
    },
    "regime_notes": "Full 15-asset cross-asset universe; at least 8 valid instruments per date. Positive but modest IC; uncertainty is material because the cross-section is small."
  },
